@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Place Order (Validate Order)

' Aceasta diagrama detaliaza cazul de utilizare "Validate Order"
' si operatia OrderService.placeOrder()
'
' Conform cerintelor (Punctul 9 din rubrica), acest scenariu este validat de 
' urmatoarele teste JUnit:
' - OrderServiceTest.placeOrder_reservesCapacity_andCreatesOrder()
' - OrderServiceTest.placeOrder_rejectsWhenCapacityExceeded()

start

:Receive Cart, Delivery Location, and Delivery Slot;

:Check Delivery Slot Capacity;
if (Is remainingCapacity >= cart item count?) then (No)
  :Throw IllegalStateException (Capacity Exceeded);
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Reserve Capacity\n(slot.release());
  :Create new Order Entity;
  
  :Convert CartItems to OrderItems;
  :Add OrderItems to Order;
  
  :Calculate Total Price;
  :Set OrderStatus to CREATED;
  
  :Clear Cart items;
  
  :Return Order;
endif

stop
@enduml
